:name: LowLS GPIO Controller
:description: Runs the GPIO controller on an STM32F4 Discovery simulation.

using sysbus

# Locate the ELF relative to this script's directory.
$elf?=$ORIGIN/../../../../build/gpio-ctrlr/gpio_controller.elf

# Create an STM32F4 Discovery machine.
mach create
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery-kit.repl

# Load the firmware into the simulated MCU.
sysbus LoadELF $elf
